OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,6,Frain expected, along with
OL,7,Fstrengthening winds. However, some
OL,8,Fdrier intervals are also probable.
OL,9,FStrongest winds expected in the east
OL,10,Fand along the coast from mid-afternoon
OL,11,Fonwards.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with showers and rain
OL,14,Fin the east, becoming more settled and
OL,15,Fdrier overnight with clearing skies
OL,16,Ffrom the west. Winds will ease
OL,17,Fslightly by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
